# Cast pillow-block bracket: an L of base and upright in one casting, the upright's top
# full round, a face fillet in the corner, a bearing boss with a seat bored from the back on
# its work axis, two gussets, mounting holes from a hole table, a cored lightening pocket.
w = 80
t = 12
ut = 14
h = 90
bz = 60
br = 20
l: extrude sym w xz poly -60 0 60 0 60 t -60+ut t -60+ut h -60 h
fullround (faces normal -x) (faces normal +z top) (faces normal +x left)
corner: facefillet 8 (faces normal +x left) to (faces normal +z bottom)
boss: extrude 30 yz at -60 0 bz circle 0 0 br
bax: axis boss (faces of boss cyl)
bp: point meet bax l (faces normal -x near -60 0 60)
bore: hole 22 -yz at -30 0 bz thru
seat: hole 28 yz at bp 8
# two gussets (TODO: fillet 3 (edges between gus l concave) (edges between gus corner concave) once regression nary_fillet_two_gussets holds: seq builds it, n-ary fails Corner)
# TODO: fullround (faces of gus normal -y) (faces of gus near -14 28 36) (faces of gus normal +y) once regression fullround_after_union holds
gus: extrude sym 10 xz at 0 28 0 poly -60+ut-1 t-1 20 t-1 -60+ut-1 bz
pattern gus mirror xz
fillet 2 (edges of gus convex)
holes: sketch xy at 0 0 t
  pt 40 25
  pt 40 -25
  pt 0 0
end
mh: hole M10 cbore -on holes p1 thru
pattern mh pts holes
chamfer 1 (edges of bore circle right) (edges of seat circle left)
